name: Loyalty Card — every-6th-hand X4
author: corpus
description: >-
  Loyalty Card gives X4 Mult on every 6th hand played (the counter ticks down after
  each hand). First-shop burst X4: maximize hand count per round with Burglar and
  avoid discarding.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: LoyaltyCard
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: Burglar
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Blueprint
    antes: [1, 2]
    score: 25
  - joker: Brainstorm
    antes: [1, 2]
    score: 25
